          ]
        },
        "\n",
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "children": [
            "Meetings 15, 16, 31, and 32. Keep the instructor’s existing grading policy. The rubric below is a feedback rubric within each existing project component, not a new course-weight scheme."
          ]
        },
        "\n",
        {
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "note"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "strong",
              "children": [
                "Existing course project:"
              ]
            },
            " Use the instructor-assigned project as the primary project. These milestones and generic exercises supplement that assignment; they do not replace its rubric or add a second required project. Where it already supplies an equivalent design, SQL, or concurrency task, submit that evidence once. Follow the assigned project’s database dialect rather than mixing it with the PostgreSQL practice fixture."
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "h2",
          "children": [
            "Milestones"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "ul",
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "li",
              "children": [
                "Meeting 4: scenario, requirements, ER model, and scope."
              ]
            },
            {
              "tag": "li",
              "children": [
                "Meeting 12: normalized schema, constraints, seed data, and dependency argument."
              ]
            },
            {
              "tag": "li",
              "children": [
                "Meeting 15: query portfolio workshop."
              ]
            },
            {
              "tag": "li",
              "children": [
                "Meeting 16: midterm project due and feedback."
              ]
            },
            {
              "tag": "li",
              "children": [
                "Meeting 28: working database application and failure tests."
              ]
            },
            {
              "tag": "li",
              "children": [
